                                                "sense_id": "7ce63c4b-7f97-386c-a108-069510a85d53",
                                                "text": "In March, Thais will vote for the 500-seat lower house of parliament. But the 250-member upper house, or Senate, will be chosen entirely by the military."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
